ds</li></ul></strong> Make a significant impact on the battlefield by selecting real life Legends with unique abilities.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/33357b13fa0aebe48b1bbb9f8389a3c0.poster.avif?t=1754663673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/33357b13fa0aebe48b1bbb9f8389a3c0.webm?t=1754663673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1270050/extras/33357b13fa0aebe48b1bbb9f8389a3c0.mp4?t=1754663673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
